<title>USA: TABLE - Exogen Inc Q2 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Exogen Inc Q2 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>PISCATAWAY, N.J. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>						  June 30,   June 30,</p>
<p>				   1997	  1996     1997     1996</p>
